  "description": "iCalendar files for Elarion (ADR-0109): CalendarReader reads .ics files leniently into events and to-dos with every error coded and located, keeps every property other programs wrote in a lossless component tree, resolves time zones and expands recurrences within a window; CalendarWriter writes calendars and feeds deterministically. No reflection and no third-party library, so an application keeps publishing with NativeAOT.",
